CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract swap _ --object-bits 16 --verbosity 9
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^[0-9]{6,} variables, [0-9]+ clauses$
--
The write set's object set indexed by object id has 2^object_bits elements.
With a constant size, the SAT back end flattened it, so the formula had more
than 600,000 variables at 16 object bits (and more than 12 million for the
same pattern in larger programs). Allocating it with a non-constant size keeps
it in the array theory: this test needs about 45,000 variables.
